      {
        "id": 243419,
        "name": "",
        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-03-11T20:34:29.108Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just for fun, I wrote up what builds I’d use to create each of the villains-turned-heroes in the LoN in the <em><strong>Sentinel Comics RPG</strong></em>:</p>\n<p><strong>Citizen Dawn</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Background:</strong> Unremarkable</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power Source:</strong> Unknown</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Archetype:</strong> Blaster</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personality:</strong> Lone Wolf</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Proletariat</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Background:</strong> Military</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power Source:</strong> Relic</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Archetype:</strong> Minion-Maker</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personality:</strong> Stalwart</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Biomancer</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Background:</strong> Created</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power Source:</strong> Artificial Being</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Archetype:</strong> Form-Changer</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personality:</strong> Analytical</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Blood Countess</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Background:</strong> Former Villain</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power Source:</strong> Cursed</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Archetype:</strong> Elemental Manipulator</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personality:</strong> Alluring</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Anubis</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Background:</strong> Exile</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power Source:</strong> Supernatural</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Archetype:</strong> Reality Shaper</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personality:</strong> Apathetic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The Operative</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Background:</strong> Struggling</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power Source:</strong> Training</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Archetype:</strong> Close Quarters Combatant</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personality:</strong> Jaded</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Magman</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Background:</strong> Criminal</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power Source:</strong> Genetic</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Archetype:</strong> Armored</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personality:</strong> Impulsive</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I’m not actually planning on building any of these characters any time soon. I might someday.</p>\n<p>Additionally, I’m happy to elaborate on any of my choices.</p>",
